{collected_item_name}
if {collected_item_name} == "Portable Sewing Kit":
	VO: Man… Barb’s grad dress ended up being totaled. Maybe if she had this she could’ve done some last minute adjustments.
	VO: I guess that’s one good thing about being in a time loop, third... or fourth or fifth time’s the charm.
	VO: Let’s hope it doesn’t come to that.

elif {collected_item_name} == "Allergy Meds":
	VO: Noah always forgets to bring his allergy meds to school... I should grab these just in case.
elif {collected_item_name} == "Belt":
	VO: Hmm, this is my belt.
	VO: This would be great for Noah’s machine.
	VO: ...
	VO: A genuine leather belt…
	VO: ...
	VO: [sigh] It’s for the greater good.
elif {collected_item_name} == "Annotated Pocket Shakespeare":
	VO: What in the world is this?
elif {collected_item_name} == "Acceptance Letter":
	VO: VO\: Huh, Juniper isn’t here.
	VO: Wait, what’s this.
	VO: An opened letter addressed to Juniper...? From Emmerdale.
	VO: It’s probably her rejection letter.
	VO: ...
	VO: Dear Miss Juniper Chandra,
	VO: it is on behalf of Emmerdale that we would like to congratulate you on your acceptance into Emmerdale’s Theoretical Physics Program—
	VO: Wait a damn minute,
	VO: This is an acceptance letter!
	VO: If she’s read this, why did Juniper say she didn’t get in?
	VO: ...
	VO: I need to ask her about it.
elif {collected_item_name} == "Pocket Watch":
	VO: This is a really nice watch.